      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated guidelines on tuberculosis: tuberculosis preventive  This second edition of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        79.31470489501953,
        527.2098388671875,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "treatment  was prepared in accordance with the requirements of the WHO Guideline Review Committee.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.4376831054688,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "The GDGs considered the certainty of the latest available evidence on effectiveness and harms and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4155883789062,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "of evidence, values and preferences and issues of equity, resource use, acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.4387817382812,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "of implementation when updating or formulating recommendations and determining their strength.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.39076232910156,
        527.4244384765625,
        147.83375549316406
      ],
      "text": "The GDG considered the implications of the best available evidence for each population subgroup",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.5907745361328,
        527.41796875,
        161.0337677001953
      ],
      "text": "at risk, the likelihood of progression from infection to TB disease of each group, and the incidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.79078674316406,
        527.4257202148438,
        174.23377990722656
      ],
      "text": "of TB disease as compared with that in the general population. The GDG used the guiding principle",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.9907989501953,
        527.4163208007812,
        187.4337921142578
      ],
      "text": "that individual benefit outweighs risk when recommending testing for TBI and TPT. TBI testing is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.19081115722656,
        527.4428100585938,
        200.63380432128906
      ],
      "text": "desirable whenever feasible to identify people at highest risk of developing TB. Tools such as chest",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3907012939453,
        527.417236328125,
        213.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "radiography (CXR) with computer aided detection (CAD) software, C-reactive protein (CRP) and WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973467826843262,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        212.59071350097656,
        527.1226196289062,
        227.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "recommended rapid molecular diagnostic tests (mWRD) should be used to rule out TB disease before",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97607421875,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.7906036376953,
        527.5929565429688,
        240.2335968017578
      ],
      "text": "TPT is started. A requirement for additional resources to implement the guidance should not be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        238.99061584472656,
        524.4303588867188,
        253.43360900878906
      ],
      "text": "viewed as a barrier but should stimulate programmatic mobilization of an appropriate level of funding.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.963589668273926,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        259.4185791015625,
        527.5057983398438,
        275.1376037597656
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated guidelines on tuberculosis:  The 21 recommendations in this edition of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.6185302734375,
        527.4468994140625,
        288.3375549316406
