      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.49462890625,
        527.2736206054688,
        327.9376525878906
      ],
      "text": "and support, managing adverse drug reactions and monitoring adverse events, adherence and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
