        188.8271026611328,
        326.69451904296875,
        220.95701599121094,
        341.1375427246094
      ],
      "text": "Table 1",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        220.9591064453125,
        326.69451904296875,
        527.4346313476562,
        341.1375427246094
      ],
      "text": "). Most of the recommendations from the 2020 version are largely",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        339.8946228027344,
        527.405517578125,
        354.337646484375
      ],
      "text": "unchanged. The changes introduced are mainly inclusion of 6 months of daily levofloxacin (6Lfx) as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        353.0946350097656,
        527.4091186523438,
        367.53765869140625
      ],
      "text": "a TPT option for people exposed to MDR/RR-TB in all settings, subject to certain conditions. Other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        366.2945251464844,
        527.4047241210938,
        380.737548828125
      ],
      "text": "recommendations relevant to PMTPT published in other WHO guidelines since 2020 are included.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        379.49462890625,
        527.6520385742188,
        393.9376525878906
      ],
      "text": "Operational limitations that require urgent action by countries in order to achieve global targets",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        391.41851806640625,
        527.438232421875,
        407.1375427246094
      ],
      "text": "WHO operational  are highlighted. The new guidelines are accompanied by a second edition of the",
