        70.86609649658203,
        419.0946044921875,
        527.4091186523438,
        433.5376281738281
      ],
      "text": "implementation of the updated guidance. The two publications are being issued as components of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
